From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] upscalers: Keep only the required DLSSG alias.

Keep the shared DLSS libraries in umu and provide only the Streamline
nvngx_dlssg.dll alias required by OptiScaler's hardcoded early load.
Other DLSS paths already use the configured NvngxFeaturePath.

Retire the five redundant installer aliases before checking versions or
downloading updates. Preserve user replacements and untracked files.
Reuse the transactional installer to roll back failed tracking updates.

Test fresh installs, offline migration, user overrides, rollback and
migration of a complete prefix from six DLSS aliases to one.
---
